description.p:
happy was able to see you!

@aiDotEngineer means a lot to me too, and so many others. Not only the densest signal conference, but also the best place to make new friends for life.

The community is so lucky to have @swyx; he is truly gifted at connecting people.

This dev breaks down how Antigravity 2.0 pairs multi-agent orchestration with MCP to pull in BigQuery, Cloud SQL, and Cloud Storage, using a customer support scenario to show specialized agents working together on one request.

{ author: Saurabh Mishra + @GoogleDevExpert }

